  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 213.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The department shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #7382, eff 10-25-00, EXPIRED: 10-25-08\n\nNew. #9332, INTERIM, eff 11-27-08, EXPIRED: 5-26-09\n\nNew. #9636-A, eff 1-12-10",
